  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a large pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the sliced onion and cook until it is translucent and starting to caramelize.",
    "Add the sliced zucchini and mushrooms and cook until they are tender.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the gochujang, soy sauce, and minced garlic.",
    "Pour the sauce over the vegetables and stir to combine.",
    "Add the Korean bun to the pan and cook until it is crispy and golden brown.",
    "Stir in the chopped green onions and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Serve the bun jjigae hot, garnished with additional green onions if desired."
